  unitName: Sera
  unitId: 20683
  unitNumber: 1110
  description: A mock Unit based on Sera Starride from the Akras Summoners' Hall
    Grand Gaia Administration Office. She is rumored to know every story and scrap
    of information that flows through the Summoners' Hall, from its internal personnel
    to the materials used in peripheral facilities. She was selected for a mock Unit
    because a certain woman asked Noel, the developer, to produce one based on her
    "friend" as well. Sera herself, however, showed no interest at all in the mock
    Unit.
  summonDesc: What? I've been summoned?<br>I'm sorry, with powers like mine I don't<br>think
    I'll be much use to you...
  fusionDesc: ......<br>Maybe I should report to Lin about how<br>I've gotten stronger...
